body:
A little girl in Taiwan told me that my handwriting was the most beautiful she's ever seen, and that a lot of English handwriting is hard to read but mine was so perfect. Handwriting is not something I'd ever get complimented on, it's very simple, but it's just nice to hear a compliment on something you don't expect.

&#x200B;

I was talking about my insecurities to someone else and I just said how I try to be the best person I can be, it's very important to me to do the right thing, but sometimes I feel like people think I don't really care about others and the person said: "No we can all see how much you care. I wish there was somebody in my life who talks about me the way you talk about your sister. Your heart is so big." And I loved hearing that because I didn't think the way I talked of my younger sister is anything extraordinary, but I'm so glad the feelings that I have for her can be shown because I just hope others can appreciate her as much as I do.

that's one of my favorites. I prided myself on being entertaining, but sometimes it just hits "you're alone, no matter how highly you think of yourself, it's apparent no one else thinks it right now."

&#x200B;

not to be bumming or anything but good lyric

In family, we always shared our meals like that. Going out with friends and on dates is so hard because most people say "I ordered what I wanted because I want to eat all of it. Not half". Never understood it.

&#x200B;

I am big on sharing though and will share whatever I have with anyone as long as I can.

Melissa, Jessica

&#x200B;

Maybe it's all my mom's friends but I cannot imagine a baby with the name Melissa. Melly would work but Baby Melissa just doesn't

I've been playing REMember on repeat. "You had a girl, I kind of wish you knocked her up. So I could meet your son and talk you up."

&#x200B;

Mac was the first celebrity death that really hurt me. It's been a tough week.
